>                   group = "school", group.equal = "loadings")
> moreFitIndices(fit.metric)

Since SEs are returned when there are equality constraints, I assume you have found a way to work around this issue by working with a Hessian or information matrix that excludes redundant parameters.  I was hoping you could provide a suggestion for a solution, or perhaps somewhere to look in your source code so I can get an idea of what you do behind the scenes.  I'd appreciate any advice you could provide.

Thank you,

Terry

